
==== JitJet chapter 9: the gate at the border, the hand-over to Geant4 ===============================
input event_PU.lhe: the signal of chapter 7 and the crowd of chapter 8; library pileup_library.lhe.gz

-- 1. the rules of the gate (g4SimHits_cfi.py, Generator PSet; Generator.cc of CMSSW_15_0_5)
   RDecLenCut = 2.9 cm: the cylinder around the beam (the beam pipe ends at r = 2.25 cm)
   eta cut 5.5: Z_lmax = R sinh(5.5) = 2.9 x 122.34 = 354.8 cm: a stable particle whose line is still
       inside r < 2.9 cm at |z| = 354.8 cm is dropped
   very-forward rule 8.2: Z_hector = R sinh(8.2) = 2.9 x 1820.5 = 5279.4 cm = 52.8 m:
       a line still inside there is given to Geant4 only for n, nbar and photons (the ZDC at 140 m)
   momentum cut: 40 MeV < |p| < 99999 GeV (MinPCut, MaxPCut)
   StackingAction: TrackNeutrino = False (the neutrinos are killed before their first step)
   PPS transport (LHCTransport): protons with |eta| > 8.2 and |pz| > 3000 GeV, handed to Geant4 at |z| = 203 m
   the edges the cuts follow: HF hole |eta| = asinh(1114.95/12.495) = 5.18 (front face) to asinh(1280.05/12.495) = 5.32 (back)

